Subject: [PATCH 10/11] CUDA: pre-Volta long-context flash attention (by
 Kmic-68)

Work by Kmic-68, from https://github.com/Kmic-68/llama.cpp, applied here as
patch 0010-kmic-long-context-fattn.patch:

- cuBLAS-GEMM flash attention for long-context prefill on pre-Volta
  (fattn-gemm.cu; Q >= 128 tokens, KV >= 4096; GGML_CUDA_FA_GEMM=0 disables)
- GQA-6 tile configs and a GQA-folded vec kernel (Qwen3.8-27B under -sm tensor)
- q4_0 K/V dequantized straight into the tile kernel's shared tile

Applied by qr0n.
